  "details": "I believe this has already been reported outside of Canny, but for the sake of redundant visibility, I'll post this here. \nWhen using Full-Body Tracking, leaning to the sides can have undesirable results with the neck and shoulder.  \nI've included a screenshot of both my avatar and a default avatar showcasing this behavior. I've tested this on other avatars(default and personal) and get the same results across all of them.",
